# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  hermes-services.env.example — deploy configuration template
#  Source this or copy to ~/hermes-cortex/.env (gitignored), then edit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ⚠  THIS FILE IS SOURCED ONLY — never deploy it to nginx.
#     It lives in deploy/ (not deploy/nginx/) to make this
#     distinction clear. Only *.conf files from deploy/nginx/
#     get deployed to the nginx config directory.
#
#  Source this file before running hermes-services-apply.py,
#  install-nginx-full.sh, or cortex-update.sh to override
#  auto-detected SSL certificate paths and nginx port prefix.
#
#  Usage:
#    set -a; source deploy/hermes-services.env; set +a
#    sudo install-nginx-full.sh
#
#  Or inline:
#    CORTEX_SSL_DOMAIN=example.com sudo install-nginx-full.sh
#
#  Copy this file, edit the values, never commit the real file:
#    cp hermes-services.env.example hermes-services.env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── SSL Certificates ────────────────────────────────────────
# Explicit cert/key paths — highest priority.
# When unset, the scripts auto-detect in this order:
#   1. CORTEX_SSL_CERT_PATH / KEY_PATH (these env vars)
#   2. /etc/letsencrypt/live/<CORTEX_SSL_DOMAIN>/
#   3. /etc/letsencrypt/live/*/ (scan all)
#   4. ~/certs/fullchain.pem + privkey.pem
# If nothing found, __SSL_CERT__ placeholders are left unchanged.

# CORTEX_SSL_CERT_PATH=/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem
# CORTEX_SSL_CERT_KEY_PATH=/etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem

# Domain for Let's Encrypt lookup (ignored if CERT_PATH is set)
# CORTEX_SSL_DOMAIN=example.com

# ── Port Prefix ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Two-digit prefix for nginx server blocks.
# Template ships as 13xxx; change to your agent's prefix:
#   12 = Joseph, 14 = Esther, etc.
# CORTEX_NGINX_PORT_PREFIX=13

# ── Repo Path ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only needed if hermes-cortex is not at $HOME/hermes-cortex.
# CORTEX_REPO=$HOME/hermes-cortex

# ── Skip nginx ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to any value to skip nginx test and reload.
# Useful for container/headless environments.
# CORTEX_SKIP_NGINX=1
